글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2012-1학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 강의평가 시행 관련 사항을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">안내하오니</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">아래의 내용을 참고하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">강의평가가 원활히 진행될 수 있도록</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">참여하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 3.84pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">1. 강의평가의 목적</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;학생에게 한 학기 동안 받은 교육에 대한 평가를 스스로 함으로써 강의에 대한 자신의 의견과</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">요구사항을 학교에 표현할 수 있는 기회를 제공하고, 강의의 주체인 교수에게는 자신의 강의에 대한</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">피드백 기회를 제공함으로써 교육의 품질을 향상하고자 한다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2. 대상강좌&nbsp; : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2012-1학기에 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)에 개설된 모든 강좌</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">(단, 석ㆍ박사 논문연구지도 과목은 제외함)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">3. 설문대상&nbsp; :&nbsp; 2012-1학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)의 강좌별 수강학생 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">4. 실시기간&nbsp; :&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2012. 5. 21(월) 09:00 ~ 2012. 6. 3(일) 23:59까지</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">5. 평가형태&nbsp; :&nbsp; 인터넷 홈페이지 원스톱서비스를 통한 설문평가</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">6. 평가방법</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 2.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">원스톱서비스 → 학사관리 → 강의평가&nbsp;→ 강의평가서작성</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">7. 강의평가 내용의 익명성은 보장됩니다. </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2012. 05</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
